# Build context for apps/*/Dockerfile (context = repository root).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
.git
.github
.claude
# Secrets at any depth: env files (an app's own .env would ship through `pnpm deploy`) and keys
# such as the GitHub App's `*.private-key.pem`.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
deploy/*.env
!deploy/local.env
context
docs
e2e
prototype
test-results
playwright-report
blob-report
.data
